feat: self-growth engine — auto-digest, social-share, channel-tracker, cron expansion

This round transforms the system from a "working service" into a self-fueling
growth machine that runs 24/7 looking for opportunities and amplifying reach.

NEW SCRIPTS:
- scripts/auto-digest.js: daily hot-topic briefings in JSON/Markdown/Tweet format,
  fire-and-forget webhook push (Telegram/Discord/Slack/webhook). Crontab'd 4x/day.
- scripts/social-share.js: multi-platform copy generator (Weibo ≤140 chars, LinkedIn
  industry post, Reddit thread, email newsletter, tweet thread). CLI + programmatic.
- scripts/channel-tracker.js: attribution engine that classifies every HTTP request by
  channel (organic/search/social/referral/api/direct) and ingests service.log to build
  per-day per-channel traffic tables. Weekly report aggregates these numbers.

CRON EXPANDED: 12 autotasker tasks (was 7):
  - 4× daily digest (0h/6h/12h/18h UTC+8 = 16:00/22:00/04:00/10:00 UTC)
  - weekly channel analysis (Monday 05:25)
  - all previous tasks preserved (watchdog/warmup/backup/rebate-snapshot/pay/reconcile/report)

ENHANCED ENDPOINTS (observability layer):
- GET /api/status: now reports uptimeSeconds, memory (rss/heap MB), lastSettledAt timestamp,
  alert queue pending count — ops can see the machine is alive without hitting the dashboard.
- GET /api/alerts/queue: read-only, no auth, shows pending/sent/failed/total counts only.
- GET /.well-known/x402: expanded with verification links, referral policy, full docs map,
  per-paid-route params, bazaar status.
- GET /feed.xml: supports ?board=<name> filter for per-board RSS feeds.
- Graceful shutdown: SIGTERM/SIGINT → drain alert queue → exit within 5s.

DOCS:
- docs/AUTO-SCALE-ENGINE.md: complete architecture blueprint (5 subsystems × 15 modules),
  Phase 1/Phase 2 roadmap, constraint list. Covers 100+ potential channels organized as
  Intelligence → Content Factory → Distribution → Revenue Loop → Feedback cycle.

VERIFICATION: prod audit 57/57 PASS; quick-prod-smoke 16/16 PASS; crontab verified at 12
tasks with other projects' 6 lines untouched.
